000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID. TMODMLST.
      *C   10/28/93.  M. L. MITCHELL    REQUEST PAR DANVILLE , #6437
      *C     CHANGED THE REQ NUMBER LENGTH FROM 6 TO 12 CHARACTERS.
      *C     ALSO MODIFIED DISPLAY BUFFERS TO ACCEPT THE NEW LENGTH.
      *C   08/08/94.  M. L. MITCHELL
      *C     CHANGED ALL REFERENCES TO COPYCSIS AND COPYMMIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C     CHANGED MEMBER NAMES TO NEW NAMES ESTABLISHED BY CAT.
      *C   04/14/1995   CA ZUBEK
      *C     ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK IF THE ITEM NUMBER ENTERED BY THE
      *C     USER IS NUMERIC.
      *C   SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619
      *C     EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE
      *C
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
000600 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   AS400.
000700 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZMODIFY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT WO-BASIC-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WBF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WLNU-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPFD-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PLANNED-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DSPLY-REC                   PIC X(2000).
       FD  WO-BASIC-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WBFREC.
       01  WBFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1001.
       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLNUREC.
       01  WLNUREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PARTS-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFDREC.
       01  WPFDREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1201.
       FD  WO-PLANNED-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WPFREC.
       01  WPFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM1101.
