           IF WPFD-STATUS NOT = "00" MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF WORK-ORDER-NO NOT = WONUM OF WPFDREC
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
134000
134100 619-RIGHT-ADJUST-ITEMNO.
134200     MOVE 4 TO SUB1, SUB2.
134300     IF ITB (SUB1) NOT = " " GO TO 619-ZEROFILL-FIELD.
134400 619-RAI-FIRST.
134500     IF ITB (SUB1) NOT = " " GO TO 619-MOVE-BYTE.
134600     IF SUB1 = 1 GO TO 619-ZEROFILL-FIELD.
134700     SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB1.
134800     GO TO 619-RAI-FIRST.
134900 619-MOVE-BYTE.
135000     IF ITB (SUB1) = " " GO TO 619-ZEROFILL-FIELD.
135100     MOVE ITB (SUB1) TO ITB (SUB2).
135200     MOVE " " TO ITB (SUB1).
135300     IF SUB1 = 1 GO TO 619-ZEROFILL-FIELD.
135400     SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB1, SUB2.
135500     GO TO 619-MOVE-BYTE.
135600 619-ZEROFILL-FIELD.
           IF ITB (1) = " " MOVE "0" TO ITB (1).
           IF ITB (2) = " " MOVE "0" TO ITB (2).
           IF ITB (3) = " " MOVE "0" TO ITB (3).
           IF ITB (4) = " " MOVE "0" TO ITB (4).
135800 619-RAI-EXIT.    EXIT.
